{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37986","headline":"恩赐樱桃分寄朝士 · 韩偓","name":"恩赐樱桃分寄朝士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未许莺偷出汉宫，上林初进半金笼。\n蔗浆自透银杯冷，朱实相辉玉椀红。\n俱有乱离终日恨，贵将滋味片时同。\n霜威食檗应难近，宜在纱窗绣户中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}